1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,690
ITI electrician hoon, par kaam bas pankhe-bulb ka milta hai.

2
00:00:04,990 --> 00:00:09,732
Deepak, ab chhat pe sooraj bikta hai! Solar panel lagaane ka kaam shuru kar!

3
00:00:10,032 --> 00:00:13,139
Solar? Didi, log itna mehnga kyun lagwayenge?

4
00:00:13,439 --> 00:00:19,076
Kyunki PM Surya Ghar Yojana mein 3 kilowatt tak 78 hazaar ki subsidy hai!

5
00:00:19,376 --> 00:00:24,861
Suryamitra training le, vendor registration kara. Tools aur seedhi, ek lakh mein taiyaar.

6
00:00:25,411 --> 00:00:29,382
Deepak, bijli ka bill 5 hazaar aata hai! Kuch karo bhai!

7
00:00:29,682 --> 00:00:35,463
3 kilowatt solar lagwaiye, uncle. Bill lagbhag zero, subsidy ka form main bharunga!

8
00:00:35,763 --> 00:00:41,161
Ek installation mein 25 hazaar tak ki kamai. Mahine ke chaar, yaani ek lakh!

9
00:00:41,461 --> 00:00:46,650
Phir service aur safai ka saalana contract bech. Ek grahak, saalon ki kamai.

10
00:00:46,950 --> 00:00:49,310
Sooraj se kamai! Deepak ki life set!
